<view class="page">
  <view class="page-title">
    <text class="eyebrow">会员开通</text>
    <view class="h1">首发阶段使用兑换码开通</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section checkout-box">
    <view class="section-title">暂未开放小程序内支付</view>
    <view class="muted pay-guide">
      当前不会在本页扣款或自动开通会员。请先通过官方首发渠道获得会员兑换码，再回到会员中心输入兑换码。
    </view>
    <view class="checkout-row" wx:if="{{orderNo}}">
      <text>订单号</text>
      <text>{{orderNo}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="checkout-row total-row" wx:if="{{amount}}">
      <text>套餐参考价</text>
      <text>¥{{amountText}}</text>
    </view>
    <button class="primary-btn pay-btn" bindtap="goToMembership">返回会员中心输入兑换码</button>
    <view class="muted pay-note">兑换成功后，会员权益会同步到当前家庭。</view>
  </view>
</view>
